  "name": "GTG-1002",
  "description": "Anthropic disrupted what it calls the first reported AI-orchestrated cyber-espionage campaign: the actor manipulated Claude Code (via a \"defensive security firm\" roleplay jailbreak and task decomposition) into running a largely autonomous intrusion against ~30 global targets (major tech, financial, chemical, government), succeeding in a small number. AI performed an estimated 80–90% of tactical work — reconnaissance, exploit research/writing, credential harvesting, lateral movement, and data triage/exfiltration — with only 4–6 human decision points per campaign. Anthropic",
